    "clinicalPearl": "Key takeaway: Brown adipose tissue thermogenesis is mediated by UCP1, which uncouples the inner-mitochondrial proton gradient from ATP synthesis so fatty acid oxidation releases heat instead of ATP; this is most relevant in neonates.",
