    "clinicalPearl": "Key takeaway: The pyrogenic cascade is pathogen/damage -> TLR-bearing immune cells release IL-1, IL-6, TNF, IFN -> hypothalamic PGE2 synthesis -> raised set point -> chills (vasoconstriction, shivering, piloerection).",
